{"file": "满朝文武都以为我败家-第61集.mp4", "ep": 61, "duration": 79.9, "segments": [{"start": 1.39, "end": 3.39, "text": "穆英 你来京师带没带工匠"}, {"start": 3.39, "end": 4.39, "text": "带了"}, {"start": 4.39, "end": 5.39, "text": "怎么了"}, {"start": 5.39, "end": 6.39, "text": "有多少"}, {"start": 6.39, "end": 7.39, "text": "三十多人"}, {"start": 7.39, "end": 10.51, "text": "都借给我"}, {"start": 10.51, "end": 11.51, "text": "天先罪"}, {"start": 11.51, "end": 13.67, "text": "我算你一成干股"}, {"start": 13.67, "end": 14.67, "text": "你说真的"}, {"start": 14.67, "end": 15.67, "text": "那还有假"}, {"start": 15.67, "end": 16.67, "text": "干不干"}, {"start": 16.67, "end": 21.06, "text": "干"}, {"start": 21.06, "end": 22.06, "text": "挣钱很厉害"}, {"start": 22.06, "end": 24.06, "text": "说是日进斗金"}, {"start": 24.06, "end": 26.47, "text": "都不为过"}, {"start": 26.47, "end": 28.47, "text": "我借给你一百名工匠"}, {"start": 28.47, "end": 29.47, "text": "全是我府上的"}, {"start": 29.47, "end": 30.47, "text": "但是"}, {"start": 30.47, "end": 32.47, "text": "我要两成干股"}, {"start": 32.47, "end": 33.57, "text": "这"}, {"start": 33.57, "end": 35.24, "text": "怎么了"}, {"start": 35.24, "end": 36.24, "text": "不够吗"}, {"start": 36.24, "end": 37.24, "text": "够是够了"}, {"start": 37.24, "end": 39.94, "text": "就是你爹那里"}, {"start": 39.94, "end": 42.94, "text": "我爹是我爹"}, {"start": 42.94, "end": 43.94, "text": "我是我"}, {"start": 43.94, "end": 44.94, "text": "我府上的工匠"}, {"start": 44.94, "end": 45.94, "text": "跟我爹没关系"}, {"start": 45.94, "end": 48.32, "text": "我是挺心动的"}, {"start": 48.32, "end": 50.96, "text": "可万一你爹不同意"}, {"start": 50.96, "end": 51.96, "text": "哪天我又说漏了嘴"}, {"start": 51.96, "end": 56.3, "text": "岂不是又害了你"}, {"start": 56.3, "end": 58.3, "text": "本公子当你是朋友"}, {"start": 58.3, "end": 59.3, "text": "若是一不小心害了你"}, {"start": 59.3, "end": 61.3, "text": "我可是会自责的"}, {"start": 61.3, "end": 62.42, "text": "方兄仁义"}, {"start": 62.42, "end": 63.42, "text": "你放心"}, {"start": 63.42, "end": 64.42, "text": "从今往后"}, {"start": 64.42, "end": 65.42, "text": "就算你说漏了嘴"}, {"start": 65.42, "end": 66.42, "text": "我也绝不怪罪你"}, {"start": 66.42, "end": 67.42, "text": "如此"}, {"start": 67.42, "end": 69.42, "text": "楚兄这一百名工匠"}, {"start": 69.42, "end": 70.42, "text": "我借了"}, {"start": 70.42, "end": 71.42, "text": "两成干股"}, {"start": 71.42, "end": 73.49, "text": "楚兄等着分红吧"}, {"start": 73.49, "end": 74.55, "text": "好"}, {"start": 74.55, "end": 76.55, "text": "以后多多仰仗方兄了"}, {"start": 76.55, "end": 77.55, "text": "哪里话"}, {"start": 77.55, "end": 79.55, "text": "咱们共同发财"}]}